{"articleNo":"80311","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=80311&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제1기 경북청년무역사관학교 교육생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.03.22","hit":"4137","attachments":[{"name":"경북청년무역사관학교 안내자료.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=80311&attachNo=72496"},{"name":"dm포스터최종.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=80311&attachNo=72679"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>기 경북청년무역사관학교 과정 개요<br></strong></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;교육목표 : 총&nbsp;2개월간 온라인 및 합숙교육을 통해 강도 높은 실무 교육과 인성 교육으로&nbsp;<br></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 엘리트 무역실무사원을 양성<br>&nbsp; ○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육기간 :&nbsp;2013. 7. 1(월)&nbsp;~ 25(목) (총 19일, 147시간, 합숙교육, 주말제외)<br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○ 교육장소 : </span>대구경북영어마을<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 온라인 학습 : 2개월, 현장실습 : 1개월<br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○ 교육인원 : 60명<br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○ 교육내용<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 온라인 학습(2개월) : 무역실무 개요<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 합숙교육(1개월) : 무역실무, 비즈영어, 해외마케팅<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 현장실습(1개월):&nbsp;무역업체/유관기관 등<br><strong><br>2.&nbsp;수료생 특전<br></strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;무역업체 현장실습 및 해외인턴십 등 취업연계 과정 지원<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;1:1 취업상담, 무역인력 DB등록 등 취업역량 강화 지원<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○ 수료증 지급 (<strong>학점인정 불가함</strong>)</span><br><br><strong>3. 교육생 모집 개요<br></strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;지원대상 : 경북 소재 대학교 또는 주소지를 둔 재학생 및 졸업(예정)자 (전공무관)</span><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> ○&nbsp;</span>모집기간 : <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">2013. 3. 18(월) ~ 4. 24(수)<br></font></strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○ 접수방법 : 인터넷 접수 (무역협회 대구경북지역본부 <a href=\"http://dg.kita.net/\"><strong><font color=\"#4169e1\"><u>http://dg.kita.net</u></font></strong></a><font color=\"#4169e1\">&nbsp;</font>&gt; 공지사항 참조)<br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;참 &nbsp;가&nbsp; 비 : 20만원</span><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; ○ 선발전형 : <strong><font color=\"#0000ff\">일반모집</font></strong> 및 학교별 교육생 <strong><font color=\"#0000ff\">추천전형</font></strong> 으로 구분하여 진행<br><br><strong>4. <font color=\"#0000ff\">추천전형</font> 지원 방법<br></strong>&nbsp; 1) 한국무역협회 대구경북지역본부 온라인 접수(<a href=\"http://dg.kita.net/\"><strong><font color=\"#4169e1\"><u>http://dg.kita.net</u></font></strong></a>)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;* <strong>2013. 4. 24(수) 까지<br></strong>&nbsp; 2) 자유양식의 이력서 및 자기소개서를 취업지원본부 E-mail로 제출(<a href=\"mailto:job@kumoh.ac.kr\"><strong><font color=\"#4169e1\"><u>job@kumoh.ac.kr</u></font></strong></a>)&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;* <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">2013. 4. 11(목) 까지<br></font></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※&nbsp;취업지원본부로 제출된 이력서 자기소개서는 추천자 선정을 위한 자료로만&nbsp;활용됨</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※ </span>추천자들의 명단만 전달하므로, 한국무역협회 대구경북지역본부 홈페이지를 통한<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 온라인 접수를 반드시 완료하여야 함<br><br><strong>5. 추천 인원</strong> : 5~10명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; * 추천자 특혜 : 온라인 접수 이후 서류전형 없이 면접으로 선발<br><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>6. 문의</strong> : 한국무역협회 대구경북지역본부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 김동욱 과장 (053-753-7531/3, <a href=\"mailto:silkkim@kita.net\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">silkkim@kita.net</font></u></a>) <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;김종훈 (053-753-7531/3, <a href=\"mailto:dgkita@kitanet\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">dgkita@kitanet</font></u></a>)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
